<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Financial Affidavit Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-logo { float: right; }
  .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%; margin-top: 50px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Pace University Logo" style="max-width: 150px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">Pace University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">Dyson College of Arts and Sciences</div>
  </div>

  <h2 style="text-align: center;">FINANCIAL AFFIDAVIT FOR INTERNATIONAL STUDENTS</h2>

  <p>An international applicant accepted for admission to a graduate program at Pace University who requires a Certificate of Eligibility for a student visa must submit the International Applicant Financial Affidavit below. The completed affidavit must be submitted with a letter from a bank indicating the availability of sufficient funds in US dollars available for one year of study. Applicants are advised to obtain two sets of bank documentation in order to have one set for the embassy.</p>

  <p>If any financial support is to be provided by one or more sponsors, the Sponsor(s) Affidavit of Support(s) must also be submitted and the sponsor(s) must provide the required bank documentation. (Note: The Sponsor Affidavit of Support which follows this page may be reproduced.)</p>

  <p>I certify that I have <span data-field="declaration_statement">{{ declaration_statement }}</span> US dollars available to me for the following expenses of my graduate education at Pace University.</p>

  <p>I have indicated the source of my financial support below and have attached original bank documentation in US dollars. The information I have provided on this affidavit is correct and complete. I know that giving false information on this affidavit or in support documentation may result in the cancellation of my admission to Pace University. I also understand that the entire tuition and general instruction fee is due at the time of registration for each term, that the insurance cost is an annual fee, and that costs may rise in succeeding terms. I also understand that if I am required to enroll for English language coursework, additional costs will ensue.</p>

  <h3 style="text-align: center;">DYSON COLLEGE OF ARTS AND SCIENCES</h3>
  <h3 style="text-align: center;">2021-2022 Total Estimated Expenses for the Fall and Spring Terms*</h3>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt; text-align: center;">(Excluding Actors Studio Drama School MFA, Counseling, Environmental Science, Homeland Security, MPA, and Publishing)</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%;">Description</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">US Dollars (self or sponsor)*</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">Source of Support (self, sponsor*, or scholarship)</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Tuition (18 credits)</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="estimated_tuition">{{ estimated_tuition }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Fees</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="estimated_fees">{{ estimated_fees }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Housing</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="estimated_housing">{{ estimated_housing }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Health Insurance</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="estimated_insurance">{{ estimated_insurance }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Other (books, personal expenses, and transportation)</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="estimated_other">{{ estimated_other }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Total:</strong></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><strong><span data-field="total_estimated_expenses">{{ total_estimated_expenses }}</span></strong></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">If you have been awarded a merit scholarship, you may deduct the amount here:</p>
  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Amount: <span data-field="scholarship_deduction">{{ scholarship_deduction }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;"><strong>Total:</strong> <span data-field="final_total_expenses">{{ final_total_expenses }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">If you plan on enrolling in summer 2021, then you must include the following as well:</p>

  <h3 style="text-align: center;">Estimated Expenses for the Optional Summer I and Summer II Terms*</h3>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%;">Description</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">US Dollars (self or sponsor)*</td>
        <td style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">Source of Support (self, sponsor*, or scholarship)</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Tuition and Fees (6 credits)</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="summer_tuition_fees">{{ summer_tuition_fees }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Housing</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="summer_housing">{{ summer_housing }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Other (books, personal expenses, and transportation)</td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="summer_other">{{ summer_other }}</span></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Total:</strong></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><strong><span data-field="summer_total_expenses">{{ summer_total_expenses }}</span></strong></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Grand Total (12 months):</strong></td>
        <td style="text-align: right;"><strong><span data-field="grand_total_12_months">{{ grand_total_12_months }}</span></strong></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 33%;">Signature</td>
        <td style="width: 33%; text-align: center;">Month</td>
        <td style="width: 33%; text-align: center;">Day</td>
        <td style="width: 33%;">Year</td>
        <td style="width: 33%;">Print Name</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="signature-line"></td>
        <td class="signature-line"></td>
        <td class="signature-line"></td>
        <td class="signature-line"></td>
        <td class="signature-line"></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <table style="width: 100%;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 50%;">Print Address</td>
        <td style="width: 25%;">Fax</td>
        <td style="width: 25%;">Email</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="print_address">{{ print_address }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 50px;">*Subject to change.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">**Each sponsor must complete an Affidavit of Support (see reverse side) and submit official bank documentation verifying availability of funds.</p>
</div>

<!-- Page 2 -->
<div class="page">
